{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1516150/extras/d7b80e15f33c424fa4e77c4aa1f8cf6a.avif?t=1753171302\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dorpie, where the sky's the limit \u2013 literally! This casual city builder challenges you to construct a whimsical vertical town that defies gravity and ignites your imagination. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Dorpie?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dorpie <i>(pronounced &quot;DOR-pee&quot;)</i> is an Afrikaans word meaning &quot;small town.&quot; But there's nothing small about the vertically sprawling villages you'll create! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1516150/extras/0e42ce21ea011bbba837c8bfac7d67c3.poster.avif?t=1753171302\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1516150/extras/0e42ce21ea011bbba837c8bfac7d67c3.webm?t=1753171302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1516150/extras/0e42ce21ea011bbba837c8bfac7d67c3.mp4?t=1753171302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a limited plot of land and a handful of structures. As you build and complete objectives, you'll unlock new buildings, decorations, and platforms. With horizontal space at a premium, your only option is to build up, up, up! Rotate and stack structures to create a unique skyline that showcases your creativity and problem-solving skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1516150/extras/704d491a13e51a9fd148c3a54e883ac2.avif?t=1753171302\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical Stacking: Master the art of building upwards to create towering masterpieces. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective-Based Progression: Complete goals to unlock new content and expand your possibilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Gameplay: Enjoy a stress-free building experience with no time pressure. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant Visuals: Immerse yourself in colorful, charming environments full of personality. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Creativity: Discover new visual themes and structures with each play session. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Sets Dorpie Apart</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Vertical Focus: Unlike traditional city builders, Dorpie challenges you to think vertically. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for Short Sessions: Ideal for players who want to create something amazing in bite-sized chunks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Complex Management: Focus on creativity without worrying about intricate resource systems. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Dorpie Does Not Offer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex resource management </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat or violence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin each run with an empty play area and a limited number of build tokens. As you construct your Dorpie, you'll uncover objectives. Complete them to earn more tokens and unlock new goals, gradually building your way to a legendary vertical village! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dorpie is lovingly crafted by Jeremy, a solo game developer from South Africa passionate about creating relaxing and creative experiences. Your feedback and suggestions are always welcome!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/d05f4108821f3b9a556b79120523eadd74fa8224.jpg"},{"name":"Road","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/322f3008136a913cdae477124c056293ba7d0c3d.jpg"},{"name":"Main Road","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/41de99468eaad9d38283b6329842fe9938239d72.jpg"},{"name":"Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/c8f61c15487a508cdfb155dd2f3edf91c31c8b48.jpg"},{"name":"Skyscraper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/8e2f79aa97a4a2cbff9e93c9b8da0ec57db0ac84.jpg"},{"name":"Garden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/6d813517dfd6318ef4fc27a9a60e5fd0af5ed77a.jpg"},{"name":"Park","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/d4e9c9f753126d1c752b3a02416da50d5b5d6702.jpg"},{"name":"Central park","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/8b424c3094ddd9531b83f87aadc481bda19c8daf.jpg"},{"name":"Floating park","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/fae8266ccd587265508a4e919db02b8e8cb08aa7.jpg"},{"name":"Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1516150/bc7e42a516290d9e44a9bd1de5da43ef553c55ef.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1516150?t=1753171302","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1516150?t=1753171302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1516150/1e5a72823b2388dcdb4a2f8c8d2c2f2d0aa9bade/capsule_23